 ],
 "strings": {
  "So, the bugs? You get 'em?": "",
  "Good. Take a seat.": "",
  "So, you wanna tap\nthe Matsugane office?": "",
  "So you wanna tap the\nMatsugane office?": "",
  "Kaito-san told you, huh?": "",
  "You've already heard, huh?": "",
  "Yup. Now explain what\nyou told me, Sugiura-kun.": "",
  "Yup. Now, Sugiura-kun,\ntell him what you told me.": "",
  "Well, uh... it's impossible. No way I can sneak in.\nThey've literally got guys on watch, man.": "",
  "Well, uh... it's impossible. No way I can sneak in.\nThey've literally got guys on watch, y'know.": "",
  "The cameras'd see me going\nin and out, too.": "",
  "And the cameras'd see me\ngoing in and out.": "",
  "And think about what'd happen if I got caught.\nThey'd beat me to death.": "",
  "And you know how dead I'd be\nif they caught me? Super dead, man.": "",
  "Guess we're screwed.": "",
  "Well, it is what it is.": "",
  "This isn't a joke, Kaito-san!": "",
  "\"Is what it is\" my ass!": "",
  "What are we gonna do?": "",
  "What are we gonna do, Kaito-san?": "",
  "All right, all right.\nChill. I thought up somethin' else.": "",
  "All right, all right, chill.\nI thought about it, and I've got a new plan.": "",
  "If Sugiura doesn't wanna sneak in...\nWe'll just find you a disguise.": "",
  "If he doesn't wanna sneak in...\nwe'll just find you a costume.": "",
  "Just hear me out.\nYou know this guy, Tak?": "",
  "Just hear me out.\nTak, you know this guy?": "",
  "Who's that?\nGuy's got a killer jacket.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I feel like I've seen him before...)</color>": "",
  "One of the Matsugane goons, yeah?": "",
  "Some Matsugane goon?": "",
  "Yup, name's Tashiro-kun.\nThe snazziest fucking yakuza in town.": "",
  "Yup, the snazziest fucking yakuza\nin town. Tashiro-kun.": "",
  "Guy never takes his shades off,\neven at night.": "",
  "Even rocks his sunglasses at night.": "",
  "Y'know, his height and build are awful close...": "",
  "Y'know, he's actually built kinda\nlike you, Tak.": "",
  "You better not be thinking\nwhat I think you're thinking.": "",
  "Who cares what he's built like...?\nWait a sec...": "",
  "If Tashiro-kun was wearin' a facemask...\nNobody'd know he was actually a different person.": "",
  "If \"Tashiro-kun\" wore a facemask,\nnobody'd know he was actually a different person. See?": "",
  "They wouldn't have a clue.": "",
  "So what, you want me to dress up like Tashiro-kun\nand infiltrate the Matsugane office?": "",
  "So you want me to dress up like Tashiro-kun\nand infiltrate the Matsugane office?": "",
  "Bingo. First thing's first, we gotta find him\nand grab his clothes and shades.": "",
  "Yep. First thing's first, we gotta find him\nand grab his clothes and shades.": "",
  "The rest'll be simple.\nJust walk in there and plant the bugs.": "",
  "The rest'll be simple.\nJust stroll right in there, and plant the bugs.": "",
  "And here I thought I was gonna\nbe able to sit this part out...": "",
  "How do I always end up\nwith the hard part?": "",
  "It's all in your capable hands now.": "",
  "I've gotta say, Kaito-san.\nYou really thought this through.": "",
  "But I'll give you this...\nIt's crazy enough to work, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Y'know before today, I always thought I was\ngonna end up back in the family somehow.": "",
  "Y'know before today... I always thought I'd end up\nback in the family. Some way or another.": "",
  "Hm? Where's this coming from?": "",
  "But there's no way.\nNot now that I defied the boss.": "",
  "Just, you know. Now I defied the boss,\nI got no chance.": "",
  "Guess there's no turning back, though.\nMight as well see this through to the end.": "",
  "Guess there's no turning back, though.\nMight as well see this through to the end. Right?": "",
  "Now let's go get Tashiro-kun's clothes!": "",
  "Okay... Time to find this Tashiro-kun,\nand strip him down.": "",
  "Sup?": "",
  "Do you, uh, have any idea\nwhere Tashiro-kun is?": "",
  "Where do I find this Tashiro-kun?\nAny clues?": "",
  "Lemme think...": "",
  "Last I heard he was working at a cabaret.\nLookin' there might be our best bet.": "",
  "Which club?": "",
  "A cabaret club? Which?": "",
  "Think it was called Emerald Hills.\nOver on Shichifuku Street.": "",
  "Sounds like we have our next stop, then.": "",
  "Okay, sounds like we have\nour next stop.": "",
  "I mean, I'm no judge of fashion or anything...\nBut this dude really never takes off his shades?": "",
  "I don't want to sound all judgey...\nBut he <font_kind=yakuza_italic>never</font_kind> takes the shades off?": "",
  "Excuse me, do you have a second?": "",
  "Welcome, sirs! Table for two?": "",
  "Welcome, sirs!\nTable for two?": "",
  "Actually, we want to ask you a question.": "",
  "Actually, we want to\nask you a question.": "",
  "This place is a Matsugane joint, yeah?": "",
  "Hm? Yes, sir.\nWhy do you ask?": "",
  "Ah— yes, sir.\nWhy do you ask?": "",
  "We're looking for somebody.\nYou know a guy named Tashiro?": "",
  "We're looking for somebody.\nEver hear of a Tashiro?": "",
  "Tashiro?": "",
  "Flashy jacket, always wears his sunglasses.\nYou've gotta know the guy.": "",
  "See, he's the guy with the flashy jacket.\nConstantly wearing sunglasses. Sound familiar?": "",
  "Oh, him!": "",
  "Oh, that guy!": "",
  "There you go.\nI knew you'd know him.": "",
  "Yeah, there you go.\nI knew you'd know him.": "",
  "Actually, he was in the club\njust a second ago.": "",
  "A customer was giving us some trouble, though...\nSo he saw them out personally.": "",
  "A customer was giving us some trouble, though...\nso he saw them out personally.": "",
  "I'm guessin' they didn't go out for drinks.": "",
  "Ya don't say. Well, guessin' they didn't\ngo out for drinks.": "",
  "Where did Tashiro take him?": "",
  "Probably toward Tenkaichi Street. He said there's\na back alley nobody ever goes in there.": "",
  "Probably toward Tenkaichi Street. From what he was saying,\nthere's a back alley with a bad rep there.": "",
  "Smart. If you're gonna beat the crap outta someone,\nbetter to do it where nobody's gonna find you.": "",
  "Sounds like he knew what he was doin'. If you're beating\nsomeone down, do it where you won't be found.": "",
  "Sometimes I think you kinda\nmiss doing that shit.": "",
  "Talking from experience?": "",
  "...Anyway, let's get movin'.": "",
  "...Anyway, let's get movin', Tak.": "",
  "Right. Thanks, pal.": "",
  "O-Of course...": "",
  "Listen, you old fuck. Didn't you see the sign?\nYou can look but not touch!": "",
  "Listen, you old fuck. Didn't you see the sign?\nHands off the merchandise!": "",
  "Please, I never touched anyone!": "",
  "No, please, I never touched anyone!": "",
  "Huh? Bullshit you didn't!\nThe girls know all about your pervy ass!": "",
  "What!? Bullshit you didn't!\nThe girls won't shut up about your pervy ass!": "",
  "There he is!\nTashiro-kun!": "",
  "There he is! Tashiro-kun!": "",
  "You, uh... weren't kidding about how he dresses.\nI'm actually kinda impressed.": "",
  "Whoa... You weren't kidding about how he dresses.\nI'm kinda impressed.": "",
  "Wait, you're... Yagami!": "",
  "Congrats, you recognized the guy\nyour whole family's after.": "",
  "Niceee, you recognized\nyour family's biggest threat.": "",
  "Shut it, asshole!": "",
  "Um, I'm just gonna...!": "",
  "Um, I'm just going to...!": "",
  "Hey! Get the hell back here!": "",
  "Hey! Get back here!": "",
  "Dammit, he got away 'cause of you!": "",
  "Lemme guess, you made that up to try n' squeeze\ncash outta the poor bastard?": "",
  "I'm guessin' you made up that whole story,\njust to squeeze cash outta that poor bastard?": "",
  "Guy like that wouldn't cop a feel\neven if your girl wanted him to.": "",
  "Huh? The fuck do you know!?": "",
  "Huh? The hell do you know!?": "",
  "Hm, sounds like you were\nright on the money.": "",
  "Huh. Sounds pretty defensive.\nMust've guessed right.": "",
  "'Course. That's how shit goes around here.\nIt's only fair that we take his clothes, yeah?": "",
  "Whaddya mean?\nThe hell're you talking about?": "",
  "My clothes?\nThe hell're you talking about?": "",
  "We'll give them back as soon as we're done.\nWon't be long, promise.": "",
  "Fuck off!\nYou got any idea how much these threads cost!?": "",
  "Fuck off!\nYou got any idea how much these cost!?": "",
  "Not a one. But you know how dangerous Kamurocho is.\nShoulda expected somebody'd wanna jump you.": "",
  "No clue. But if you're gonna wear that shit in a city\nlike this? Someone's gonna jump you eventually.": "",
  "We won't have to hurt you if you just hand them over.\nEverything'll stay nice and clean, too.": "",
  "Just hand them over, and we can keep everything\nnice, clean, and nonviolent.": "",
  "It's a win-win. So?\nAre you stripping or not?": "",
  "It's a win-win.\nSo, are you stripping or no?": "",
  "What kinda question is that, pretty boy!?\nIf you want my clothes, you're gonna have to rip 'em off!": "",
  "What kinda question is that!?\nIf you want my clothes, you're gonna have to <font_kind=yakuza_italic>take</font_kind> 'em!": "",
  "Okay, let's just get this over with, Tak.": "",
  "Well, let's get this\nover with, Tak.": "",
  "Yup, don't want anyone walking in on this.": "",
  "Yup. Don't want anyone\nwalking in on this.": "",
  "Shit, this guy's fuckin' loaded.\nHis wallet's bursting at the goddamn seams.": "",
  "Whoa, this guy's fuckin' loaded.\nCheck out his wallet! Bursting at the goddamn seams.": "",
  "Don't take his money.\nWe're not thieves.": "",
  "Hands off.\nThis wasn't supposed to be a shakedown.": "",
  "Yeah, yeah. I know...\nWait, don't clothes count as stealing?": "",
  "Yeah, yeah. I know...\nWait. Aren't we're stealing his clothes?": "",
  "Like I said earlier,\nwe're just borrowing them for a bit.": "",
  "We're just borrowing them\nfor a bit, right?": "",
  "If you say so.\nYou're the lawyer.": "",
  "If you say so. You're the lawyer.": "",
  "Man, they fit even better than I was expecting.\nYou look good, Tak.": "",
  "Man, they fit better than I was expecting.\nIt suits you, Tak!": "",
  "That's the last thing I wanna hear.": "",
  "That's not a compliment.": "",
  "Anyway. You better get to the Matsugane office\nand plant those bugs before our friend wakes up.": "",
  "Anyway. You better get to the Matsugane office.\nPlant those bugs before our friend wakes up.": "",
  "Speaking of, Kaito-san.\nThink you can take care of him?": "",
  "Oh, Kaito-san.\nThink you can handle Tashiro-kun?": "",
  "Huh? \"Handle\" how?": "",
  "We can't leave the guy naked\noutside at this time of year.": "",
  "We can't leave the guy naked outside\nat this time of year.": "",
  "Heh, always a big softie.": "",
  "Heh, you always were a big softie.": "",
  "Sure, I'll handle him. Can't go with you,\nanyway. Not lookin' like regular old Kaito.": "",
  "Sure, I'll take care of it. Not like I can come along\nanyway... No disguise for me.": "",
  "Tak... Don't mess this up.": "",
  "Tak... Don't mess this up, okay?": "",
  "I won't.": "",
  "I'll be fine.": "",
  "Whoa, what in the absolute fuck is this!?": "",
  "Whoa, what the absolute fuck is <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind>!?\nPffhahahaha!": "",
  "Oh spare me.\nThey're not my clothes.": "",
  "Oh, shut up.\nThese are Tashiro-kun's clothes.": "",
  "Okay, okay. I'm okay.\nSee you out front of the Matsugane office.": "",
  "...Okay. See you out front\nof the Matsugane office.": "",
  "All right.\nI'll be right over.": "",
  "Sorry for the wait, Sugiura.": "",
  "Sugiura. Sorry for the wait.": "",
  "Hey. Sugiura?": "",
  "Sorry, I think you have the wrong guy.": "",
  "Sorry, do I know you?": "",
  "Pffft! God, I just can't help it!": "",
  "Pffft! I can't even do it...!": "",
  "We don't have time for this.": "",
  "I can't help it, man! That's the loudest disguise\nI've ever seen in my life!": "",
  "I can't help it, man! Who could've\nimagined <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> would be your disguise!?": "",
  "Maybe you wanna try\nplanting these instead?": "",
  "Maybe <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> wanna try\nplanting these bugs instead.": "",
  "Sorry, sorry.\nIt's perfect, honest.": "",
  "Yeah, whatever.\nCan we get this over with now?": "",
  "Sure. Let's just get this over with.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I should be able to get a read\non the bugs right after you set 'em.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I should be able to monitor the bugs\nright after you set 'em.": "",
  "Just come on out when you're all done.": "",
  "Just come on out when\nyou're all done.": "",
  "So, you ready?": "",
  "Yeah, good to go.": "",
  "Pfft...": "",
  "Urk... pfft...": "",
  "It's really not that funny.": "",
  "I need a little time, sorry.": "",
  "No, I still need some more time.": "",
  "Really? Eh, no harm in bein' careful.\nWe've only got one shot at this!": "",
  "...Really? Eh, no harm in bein' careful.\nWe've only got one chance here.": "",
  "What're you doing, Yagami-san!?\nYou can't go in like that!": "",
  "Whoa, Yagami-san!?\nYou can't go in like that!": "",
  "Uh, but... those are...": "",
  "Get into Tashiro-kun's clothes\nbefore they see you!": "",
  "Yeah, yeah...": "",
  "Dammit, fine, fine...": "",
  "You ready, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yagami-san, you ready?": "",
  "(First I need to meet up\nwith Sugiura.)": "",
  "Oh!": "",
  "Stylish as ever, Tashiro! Me and you,\nwe gotta hit the clubs sometime!": "",
  "You're lookin' stylish as ever, man!\nMe and you, we gotta hit the clubs sometime!": "",
  "You're totally in the clear.\nNobody's gonna doubt that you're Tashiro-kun.": "",
  "You're good.\nNobody's gonna suspect you're not Tashiro-kun.": "",
  "(I've gotta get these bugs planted, fast.\nI don't wanna wander around town dressed like this anyway.)": "",
  "(I've gotta get these bugs planted, fast.\nThe less time I spend here, the better.)": "",
  "Hey, Tashiro.": "",
  "All clear at Emerald Hills?": "",
  "All clear at Emerald Hills?\nYou got the problem solved?": "",
  "Glad you can take care of yourself. We got enough\nto worry about looking for Yagami.": "",
  "Yeah, we got enough shit tied up in chasing Yagami.\nGood to know you can handle your stuff.": "",
  "By the way, mind keeping an eye\non the office for me?": "",
  "Oh, I know. Can you keep an eye\non the office?": "",
  "Gonna head to the convenience store,\ngrab a snack. I'll be back in five.": "",
  "I'm gonna run down to the convenience store.\nI'll be back in five minutes.": "",
  "(Doesn't look like he noticed.)": "",
  "(Conveniently, I'm alone now.\nI've gotta set these bugs before he gets back.)": "",
  "(Question is, where's the best place...?)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It's an outlet. I'll put one here.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Found one. I'll put one here.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I bought this coffee maker for Matsugane-san\nwith my very first paycheck.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(He was so happy when I gave it to him.\nHe still uses it, though?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm? If the coffee maker's here,\nthen there has to be an outlet nearby.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Where is it?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The coffee maker cord goes behind\nthis potted plant.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That means there has to be\nan outlet back here.)</color>": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Guess we're screwed.": "ท่าทางเราซวยแล้วสินะ",
  "Hm? Where's this coming from?": "หืม? จู่ๆ ถามเรื่องนี้ทำไม?",
  "Sup?": "เป็นไงมั่ง?",
  "Lemme think...": "ขอฉันคิดดูก่อน...",
  "I won't.": "ไม่บอกหรอกค่ะ",
  "I'll be fine.": "ฉันไม่เป็นไรหรอก",
  "Sorry, do I know you?": "ขอโทษที รู้จักกันเหรอ?",
  "Uh, but... those are...": "เอ่อ แต่... พวกนั้นมันเป็น...",
  "Yeah, yeah...": "เออๆ...",
  "Oh!": "อ้อ!"
 }
}
